{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00447",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.58,
      "end_seconds": 5.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Doctor, hello, I've got my papers here, where should I put them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.09,
      "end_seconds": 9.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.36,
      "end_seconds": 19.91,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "Hmm, I've been dealing with yellow eyes. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.38,
      "end_seconds": 22.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.68,
      "end_seconds": 26.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I've had it since this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.63,
      "end_seconds": 36.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Alright, is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.85,
      "end_seconds": 45.6,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.58,
      "end_seconds": 48.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Any black stools or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.65,
      "end_seconds": 52.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.47,
      "end_seconds": 57.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.15,
      "end_seconds": 69.86,
      "duration_seconds": 11.71,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.04,
      "end_seconds": 71.97,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.25,
      "end_seconds": 78.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Right, no, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.57,
      "end_seconds": 97.83,
      "duration_seconds": 15.26,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.56,
      "end_seconds": 100.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.4,
      "end_seconds": 106.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.34,
      "end_seconds": 112.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Yeah, no, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.78,
      "end_seconds": 116.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.47,
      "end_seconds": 119.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.78,
      "end_seconds": 125.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.32,
      "end_seconds": 134.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Okay, you know, so no, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.1,
      "end_seconds": 141.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.76,
      "end_seconds": 154.39,
      "duration_seconds": 11.63,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.42,
      "end_seconds": 157.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.73,
      "end_seconds": 159.63,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Nothing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.63,
      "end_seconds": 163.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.09,
      "end_seconds": 168.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.69,
      "end_seconds": 175.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.79,
      "end_seconds": 178.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.21,
      "end_seconds": 197.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Liver edge is just palpable and mildly tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.19,
      "end_seconds": 198.89,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.77,
      "end_seconds": 205.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.57,
      "end_seconds": 209.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.96,
      "end_seconds": 210.77,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.32,
      "end_seconds": 240.71,
      "duration_seconds": 15.39,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with jaundice with a cause we still need to find at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.45,
      "end_seconds": 245.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.43,
      "end_seconds": 266.6,
      "duration_seconds": 18.17,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now jaundice with a cause we still need to find is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had yellow eyes, since this morning, and no weight loss or black stools."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.97,
      "end_seconds": 269.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.97,
      "end_seconds": 277.82,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "I'm going to order an ultrasound of the abdomen, for jaundice. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 278.13,
      "end_seconds": 281.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "I can book that for Thursday at 3:30 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.29,
      "end_seconds": 304.56,
      "duration_seconds": 21.27,
      "text": "Please avoid alcohol completely and don't take any painkillers except paracetamol, and not much of that. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. We'll refer you to a liver specialist. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you vomit blood or become drowsy or confused."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.15,
      "end_seconds": 308.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.01,
      "end_seconds": 311.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Please come and see me in three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.66,
      "end_seconds": 316.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.3,
      "end_seconds": 322.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.55,
      "end_seconds": 327.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "So, you know, I come back in three days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.23,
      "end_seconds": 332.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.17,
      "end_seconds": 337.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "No, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}